WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.658
ANY and ALL compare one outer value with an entire
set ANY means

00:00:05.685 --> 00:00:11.239
at least one comparison must succeed ALL means every
comparison

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:16.775
must succeed PostgreSQL also supports SOME as a
synonym

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:22.627
for ANY The difference sounds small but it can
produce very different result

00:00:22.653 --> 00:00:23.140
sets
